<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:26:22 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>我领导了 Big 10 价值 24 亿美元的公共资本项目。这是大学体育下一步需要的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/07/college-sports-professional-management-investment/</link><description>大学为人才支付专业价格，但却忽视了帮助球队获胜的基础设施。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_1513JPG.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:38:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/07/college-sports-professional-management-investment/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 正在发起一项“总统参与”计划，在 2028 年大选之前就人工智能政策向候选人提供建议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/anthropic-presidential-engagement-program-hiring-political-lead-2028-elections/</link><description>“我们希望两党中每一位认真的候选人和当选官员都能了解这项技术以及妥善治理它的理由。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297781315-e1791491801228.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 23:14:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/anthropic-presidential-engagement-program-hiring-political-lead-2028-elections/</guid></item><item><title>NFL 敦促最高法院支持州赌博规则——在预测市场上与其他联盟决裂</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/nfl-supreme-court-state-gambling-rules-leagues-prediction-markets/</link><description>联盟希望“在下一个 NFL 赛季结束之前”做出澄清，以保持比赛的完整性。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2260086960-e1791490146837.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:12:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/nfl-supreme-court-state-gambling-rules-leagues-prediction-markets/</guid></item><item><title>马克·库班（Mark Cuban）谈为什么人工智能是错误的就业杀手目标：这是医疗保健成本，愚蠢的</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/mark-cuban-on-why-ai-is-the-wrong-job-killer-target-its-the-healthcare-costs-stupid/</link><description>这位亿万富翁兼 Cost Plus Drugs 创始人表示：“指责人工智能比指责医疗保健成本要容易得多。”数学证明了他的观点。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2293234087-e1791483386434.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 19:16:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/mark-cuban-on-why-ai-is-the-wrong-job-killer-target-its-the-healthcare-costs-stupid/</guid></item><item><title>“每个人都知道你脱离了现实”：Palantir 首席执行官亚历克斯·卡普 (Alex Karp) 表示，他自己的高管告诉他不要再炒作 Foundry</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/everybody-knows-youre-out-of-touch-palantir-ceo-alex-karp-says-his-own-exec-told-him-to-stop-hyping-foundry/</link><description>卡普告诉一屋子的首席执行官，他最好的想法是他的团队认为行不通的想法，风投们曾经问他：“寄生虫在哪里？” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2212772079-e1791475107350.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 17:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/everybody-knows-youre-out-of-touch-palantir-ceo-alex-karp-says-his-own-exec-told-him-to-stop-hyping-foundry/</guid></item><item><title>“我们很高兴能回来”：SpaceX 的回收船在完成八个月的任务后将四名宇航员带回地球</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/spacex-four-astronauts-back-earth/</link><description>机组人员于二月份前往太空，以取代四名空间站乘客，这四名乘客因其中一名乘客生病而提前回家&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26281636142480-e1791491491603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:42:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/spacex-four-astronauts-back-earth/</guid></item><item><title>一位 FEMA 管理员在飓风清理期间寻找吃饭的地方后创建了华夫饼屋指数，但只有华夫饼屋还在营业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/waffle-house-index-natural-disaster-relief/</link><description>当人们需要一个地方给手机充电和吃饭时，这家连锁店会保持营业，这使它成为一个异常可靠的灾难管理机构&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26281574680929-e1791490782865.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:28:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/waffle-house-index-natural-disaster-relief/</guid></item><item><title>“给猪涂口红”：专家称，特朗普的红色柴油计划比汽油价格解决方案更具中期吸引力，甚至卡车司机也承认他是在虚张声势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-red-dyed-diesel-midterm-elections-gas-prices-iran-war/</link><description>由于伊朗战争使柴油价格维持在每加仑 6 美元以上，分析师表示，降低成本的唯一方法是缓解地缘政治紧张局势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2286394320-e1791476825410.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:42:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-red-dyed-diesel-midterm-elections-gas-prices-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在暂停微软H-1B签证并指控“外国契约劳工”取代国内工人后向微软首席执行官颁发国家勋章</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-national-medal-microsoft-ceo-visas-foreign/</link><description>获得总统科技成果奖的六位科技领军人物中，有五位来自国外。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26281642796899-e1791490162520.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:13:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-national-medal-microsoft-ceo-visas-foreign/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普政府暂停向微软发放绿卡，因为万斯指责该公司用“外国契约仆人”取代下岗工人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-admin-green-card-microsoft-domestic-workers/</link><description>此类项目经常成为一些特朗普支持者的目标，他们认为这些项目削弱了美国学生和工人的利益。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26281553191074-e1791489557990.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 20:09:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-admin-green-card-microsoft-domestic-workers/</guid></item></channel></rss>